ctable dates with `minValue` / `maxValue`."},"502":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-36","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#with-error","content":"An invalid picker showing a validation message via `isInvalid` and a `FieldError`."},"503":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-37","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#disabled","content":"A disabled picker via `isDisabled`."},"504":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-38","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#composed","content":"Write the trigger and the overlay yourself instead of composing `DatePickerCalendar`, for full\ncontrol over the popover and the calendar."},"505":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-39","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#composed-range","content":"Write a DateRangePicker's trigger and overlay from lower-level pieces the same way."},"506":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-40","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#sizes","content":"`size` sets the label, trigger, and calendar. Without it, the picker follows the surrounding\nsize scope."},"507":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"page","content":"Drawer","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer"},"508":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge, supporting sidebar navigation and bottom sheets."},"509":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#installation","content":"Installation"},"510":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-2","page_